# SEO and launch

Reference: [Seologic pre-launch SEO checklist](https://www.seologic.by/blog/chek-list-po-seo-chto-nuzhno-proverit-pered-zapuskom-novogo-sajta).

## Critical for this project
1. **Clean URLs** — currently hash (`#marketing/crm`). Before production: History API + server rewrites (`/marketing/crm`), update `sitemap.xml`, canonical in `seo-meta.jsx`.
2. **Domain** — replace `https://pharmconsilium.by` in `index.html`, `robots.txt`, `sitemap.xml`, `js/data/seo-meta.jsx` (`SITE.baseUrl`).
3. **Meta per page** — `SEO_STATIC` + auto from `SUBPAGES`/`PORTFOLIO` via `updatePageSeo`. New route = SEO entry.
4. **One H1** per screen; H2/H3 hierarchy; keywords in title/description naturally, no stuffing.

## Technical checklist
| Task | Where |
|------|--------|
| robots.txt | root; `print.html` — Disallow |
| sitemap.xml | add all URLs after hash migration |
| HTTPS | hosting; HTTP→HTTPS redirect |
| Performance | production React; trim Google Fonts; WebP for rasters; lazy-load robot |
| Mobile | responsive CSS — verify at 375px |
| SSL + security | hosting; CAPTCHA on forms (when added) |

## Content and media
- Unique `title` and `meta description` (~160 chars) per page.
- Meaningful `alt` on `<img>` (not empty).
- Internal links: `related` in SUBPAGES, cards, mega-menu.

## Analytics (before release)
Enable and verify: **Yandex Metrica**, **Yandex Webmaster**, **Google Analytics 4**, **Search Console**. Goals: «Контакты» click, form submit.

## Local SEO (Belarus)
NAP in footer; **Yandex Business** / Google Business profiles; local keywords («Беларусь», «РБ», «Минск») in copy where appropriate.

## Before each release
- [ ] Domain and canonical are current
- [ ] Sitemap submitted to Webmaster and Search Console
- [ ] No `noindex` on public pages
- [ ] PageSpeed / mobile test passed
- [ ] All SUBPAGES from menu open (not “in development” without reason)
